                <span class="lang-ja">Meaning in this report</span>
                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Meaning in this report</span>
              </th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem;">workspace classification</td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem;">
                <span class="lang-ja">企画・適用範囲定義・プロジェクト標準</span>
                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Planning, Scope Definition, Project Standards</span>
              </td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem;">
                <span class="lang-ja">AIが触れてよい範囲とルールを事前に定義する作業</span>
                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Pre-defining the scope and rules for AI operations</span>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem;">no writes before classification</td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem;">
                <span class="lang-ja">要件確定前の実装抑止</span>
                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Preventing Implementation Before Requirements</span>
              </td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem;">
                <span class="lang-ja">ルールの事前定義なしにソースコードの変更を許さない制約</span>
                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Constraint forbidding code changes before rule definition</span>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem;">Ask Gate</td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem;">
                <span class="lang-ja">未決事項管理・合意形成ゲート</span>
                <span class="lang-en" lang="en">Pending Issue Management, Consensus Gate</span>
